  "hr8e928ecf6b": "Pantoo uses and transmits precise location for attendance and location requests during active work sessions. Your location can be viewed by authorized HR admins at your company.\n\nThe browser may limit location access when the tab is inactive. Tracking stops when the tab is closed. For background tracking, use the Android app.\n\nLocation is not used for advertising. You may decline; features that do not require location will remain available.",
  "@hr8e928ecf6b": {
    "description": "Modul: global. Audit: HR-ID-8E928ECF6B"
  },
  "hr4280a55571": "Pantoo collects and transmits precise location data to enable attendance and live tracking during work and overtime sessions, including when the app is closed or not in use.\n\nLocation is sent securely to Pantoo servers and can be viewed by authorized HR admins at your company to monitor work sessions.\n\nLocation is not used for advertising or shared for other purposes. Tracking stops automatically when you check out or sign out. You may decline; Pantoo features that do not require live tracking will remain available.",
  "@hr4280a55571": {
    "description": "Modul: global. Audit: HR-ID-4280A55571"
  },
